    "content": "{\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"Estimated list-price spend from 2026-10-06 to 2026-10-17 was $1,271.58, covering 13,258 model calls.\",\"cites\":[\"s1.1\",\"s1.2\"]},{\"text\":\"Estimated list-price spend from 2026-10-18 to 2026-10-29 was $896.78, covering 14,583 model calls.\",\"cites\":[\"s2.1\",\"s2.2\"]},{\"text\":\"The first period cost $374.80 more than the second period.\",\"cites\":[\"c1.1\"]},{\"text\":\"The second period was 70.5% of the first period.\",\"cites\":[\"c1.2\"]},{\"text\":\"Five changes were recorded between 2026-10-04 and 2026-10-18.\",\"cites\":[\"ch1.1\"]},{\"text\":\"In the week starting 2026-10-06, model claude-opus-5 made up 74.9% of calls, up from 56.5% the week before.\",\"cites\":[\"ch1.2\",\"ch1.3\"]},{\"text\":\"In the week starting 2026-10-06, model claude-sonnet-5-5 made up 23.2% of calls, down from 41.5% the week before.\",\"cites\":[\"ch1.4\",\"ch1.5\"]},{\"text\":\"In the week starting 2026-10-13, model claude-opus-5 made up 24.0% of calls, down from 74.9% the week before.\",\"cites\":[\"ch1.6\",\"ch1.7\"]},{\"text\":\"In the week starting 2026-10-13, model claude-sonnet-5-5 made up 70.8% of calls, up from 23.2% the week before.\",\"cites\":[\"ch1.8\",\"ch1.9\"]},{\"text\":\"Tool version vsample-2 first appeared on 2026-10-14.\",\"cites\":[\"ch1.10\"]},{\"text\":\"Model claude-haiku-5-5 and plan setting tier standard speed standard remained unchanged throughout the window.\",\"cites\":[\"ch1.11\",\"ch1.12\"]}]}",
